{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791981480, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T12:38:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T12:39:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791981540, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T12:38:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8357, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北的樹大少了 ，且修樹常常修太多或者亂砍，真的很醜。若是為了颱風而修剪過多，這樣還有種樹的必要？", "display_name": "大安代表 Kakiliu", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T12:38:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5670, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "請不要亂砍樹，我住在內湖有看到砍樹現象", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.5,670", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T12:38:21+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54283, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當選市長，（純舊制）勞工退休金會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.54,283", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T12:38:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 647, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "請整頓巷弄內汔機車混亂及危規停放的問題", "display_name": "大安代表 吳慶祥", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T12:38:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37787, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北市應該是一座美麗的城市，但是樹被砍光、舊房子太多，台北市需要美學", "display_name": "北投代表 No.37,787", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 5670, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.5,670", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 54283, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.54,283", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"p